version: 18.1.4
date-released: 2026-07-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/Theclimateguy/GIM"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A year-by-year deterministic simulation of the world as 57 interacting
  country agents: economy and prices, climate and carbon cycle, natural
  resources, society and politics, interstate relations, and discrete crises
  with stock-flow-consistent finance. Includes history-matched ensembles,
  weak-signal detection, stability analysis, and a game-mechanical scenario
  layer.
keywords:
  - integrated assessment model
  - world simulation
  - scenario analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - serious games
